ragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(。・ω・。)正義！"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-15454":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな！せーので、\n「能條さんアリスーー！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って叫んでください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せーの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「能條さーーーーーんアリスーーー......」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/11/29/3365530/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ふわふわのスリッパがほしいの......❤」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言いそうな顔だね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なーんでこんな格好してるかというとねそうだなー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーとつまりは、よくあるコスプレをしてプリクラを撮るってやつをねこの間初めてやったの(#^.^#)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほら、若者がよくやってんじゃん☺"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしも一応若者だから挑戦してみてしまった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思った以上に楽しくてノリノリになってしまったのは言うまでもない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條さんアリスいかがかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしの個人PV「レバーこわい」\nフルで観たよーゆう方ー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうだったですか！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに飛鳥からは「あみのがなかなか面白かった！」っていうお墨をいただきました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう飛鳥生命。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/11/29/3365530/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは何をしてもらってるところか...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フルで観た方はすぐわかったはず。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3役のうちの一人、江戸っ子娘は先端恐怖症という設定。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中でとげとげしてる物を見させられて恐くて気絶してしまうシーン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條さんが白目むいて泡を吹いてます。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シュール......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分で観て笑ってしまった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにこの泡はおいしいおいしいスタバのカプチーノの上の泡の部分。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少々ほろ苦いコーヒーの味もしました(^_-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非このシーンも一時停止してよーく注目してみてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑わずにはいられない、はず。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと私が参加させていただいてるカップリング曲"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「やさしさとは」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聞いていただけましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌唱メンバーがなんとも不思議なの❤笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみん、さゆりん、ひめたん、若月、生ちゃん、七瀬、私。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おおーって感じ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よりどりみどり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早くライブとかで披露したいですな❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしはこの辺でっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.n